  "_profiles_note": [
    "FR-ONB-004: the legal form drives the default chart. FR-ONB-005: that chart is",
    "the MKB profile for the form. `common` is merged into every profile by the",
    "loader - written once so the DIFFERENCES between legal forms are what a reader",
    "sees, which is the part FR-ONB-004 is actually about.",
    "",
    "account_code follows Dutch practice (0 fixed assets and equity, 1 current",
    "assets and liabilities, 2 suspense, 4 operating expenses, 7 cost of sales,",
    "8 revenue). It is a convention, not RGS - RGS is the rgs_code beside it.",
    "",
    "control_kind marks the two accounts FR-GL-006 reserves: postings reach them",
    "only through a sub-ledger party, never directly."
  ],
